    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite <strong>1-8</strong> player Co-op top-down dungeon crawler. <strong>Slay</strong> mobs, <strong>loot</strong> chests, <strong>explore</strong> the map, <strong>craft</strong> wands and <strong>upgrade</strong> spells in a team attempt to escape from the magical dimension by conquering all <strong>4 seasons</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends or strangers in  <strong>online Co-op</strong>. A coven can have up to 8 players - public and private lobbies are supported. The game can also be played singleplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/d640b24eec801134e32bf26a888bc1b8.poster.avif?t=1754466649\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/d640b24eec801134e32bf26a888bc1b8.webm?t=1754466649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your loot</strong> - chests have 3 options to choose and all players can open each chest!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your spell builds</strong> - there are 9 spells and each one has many unique upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft powerful wands</strong> - fuse magical objects you find along the way!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/93c0392ae66a49d98309013c90f87906.poster.avif?t=1754466649\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/93c0392ae66a49d98309013c90f87906.webm?t=1754466649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goals is to escape the magical dimension by slaying <strong>4 unique bosses</strong>, one for each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy</strong> is key - is your coven skilled enough to win?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/88c27fc2271e3e7f5ad15fa42297b454.poster.avif?t=1754466649\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/88c27fc2271e3e7f5ad15fa42297b454.webm?t=1754466649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelite <strong>1-8</strong> player Co-op top-down dungeon crawler. <strong>Slay</strong> mobs, <strong>loot</strong> chests, <strong>explore</strong> the map, <strong>craft</strong> wands and <strong>upgrade</strong> spells in a team attempt to escape from the magical dimension by conquering all <strong>4 seasons</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends or strangers in  <strong>online Co-op</strong>. A coven can have up to 8 players - public and private lobbies are supported. The game can also be played singleplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/d640b24eec801134e32bf26a888bc1b8.poster.avif?t=1754466649\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/d640b24eec801134e32bf26a888bc1b8.webm?t=1754466649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your loot</strong> - chests have 3 options to choose and all players can open each chest!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your spell builds</strong> - there are 9 spells and each one has many unique upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft powerful wands</strong> - fuse magical objects you find along the way!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/93c0392ae66a49d98309013c90f87906.poster.avif?t=1754466649\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/93c0392ae66a49d98309013c90f87906.webm?t=1754466649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goals is to escape the magical dimension by slaying <strong>4 unique bosses</strong>, one for each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy</strong> is key - is your coven skilled enough to win?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/88c27fc2271e3e7f5ad15fa42297b454.poster.avif?t=1754466649\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548370/extras/88c27fc2271e3e7f5ad15fa42297b454.webm?t=1754466649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
